    {
      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "NEXT STEPS",
      "role_note": "HANDOFF LAW",
      "narration_text": "Your turn. Before building your next agent, ask what's actually managing its context, its tool-call errors, and its long-running state — if the honest answer is nothing, the model just handles it, that's the harness you don't have yet.",
